From: checklist-patch
Subject: [PATCH] API Gateway cloud.ru Evolution + CF path via ?__path=

# Yandex CF does NOT support URL paths after function id:
#   https://functions.yandexcloud.net/<id>/health → 400 invalid functionID
# Path is passed as ?__path=/health (or X-Original-Path) for external proxies.
#
# APIGW_PROVIDER=cloudru (default) | yandex
# Apply from repo root:
#   git apply --whitespace=nowarn checklist-apigw-cloudru-evolution.patch

